 owships 2028-2029 (scholars\, scientists\, artists and cultural profession
 als\; stipend\, amount not published)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 01 Feb 2027 at 23:59 CET.\n\nThe Hamburg Institute for A
 dvanced Study brings international fellows to Hamburg to work on a project
  of their own alongside a local tandem partner from one of the city's univ
 ersities or research institutions. The open call for 2028-2029 covers all 
 disciplines and explicitly includes the arts.\n\nOrganisation: Hamburg Ins
 titute for Advanced Study (HIAS)\nLocation: Hamburg\, Germany (fellows liv
 e and work in Hamburg\; applicants from the Hamburg metropolitan region ar
 e not eligible)\nAward: Paid\, amount not published. HIAS either pays a st
 ipend to the fellow or partially reimburses the home institution's costs f
 or a teaching replacement. Housing in the University of Hamburg guesthouse
  is possible depending on availability. Travel costs are not mentioned in 
 this call.\nDuration: At least three months within the academic year 1 Oct
 ober 2028 to 30 June 2029\n\nMore: https://hias-hamburg.de/en/fellowship/a
 pplication/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
