 y\, January to June 2027 (six months of coaching in art\, science and tech
 nology\, costs covered by iii)
DESCRIPTION:iii\, the artist-run platform in The Hague for art at the inter
 sections of technology\, performance and the senses\, opens a call twice a
  year for artists who want coaching. Trajectories run January to June and 
 July to December\; this call is for January to June 2027.\n\nOrganisation:
  iii (instrument inventors initiative)\nLocation: The Hague and the Randst
 ad area\, Netherlands. No nationality or residence rule is stated\, but ar
 tists must be able to meet regularly with coaches\, who are mostly based i
 n the Randstad and predominantly in The Hague.\nAward: No cash to the arti
 st. iii covers the full cost of a six-month coaching trajectory for artist
